<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Casa Autrey.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Casa Autrey.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investment said it started coverage of Mexican specialty retailer Grupo Casa Autrey with an &quot;underperform&quot; rating.</p>
<p>-- Santander said it expected Autrey to report earnings per ADR of $0.88 in 1996, $0.97 in 1997 and $1.11 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- It said the 12- to 18-month ADR target price of $22.75 implies 15.9 percent upside from the current level.</p>
<p>--Martin Langfield, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558</p>
</text>
